%%label III. Largo
%%note A very quiet string chorale that never changes. A horn asks the same question five times; the woodwind answer four times, each time faster and more crowded; the last question is left unanswered.
X:1
T:Ives’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Largo
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Charles Ives
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Largo" 1/4=46
%%score [fl ob cl] [hn]  [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn. I–IV"
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
K:G
V:fl
